  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forests in focus: Strengthening capacities for sustainable forest management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO, in collaboration with global partners, will develop and implement a targeted training and exchange programme for CPF national focal points, particularly those leading on forestry and the Rio Conventions. This initiative will enhance coordination and cross-sectorial collaboration, not only at the national level but also by linking national efforts to global policy frameworks and international best practices.</narrative>
  </description>
